---
import SectionHead from "./SectionHead.astro";
const categories = [
  { name: "Human judgment", note: "Stays with your people", tone: "dark" },
  { name: "Context with review", note: "AI prepares, a person approves", tone: "mid" },
  { name: "Repetitive execution", note: "Automated end to end", tone: "light" },
];
---

<section class="section approach" id="approach">
  <div class="container">
    <SectionHead eyebrow="How we work" title="Start with an honest assessment. End with a transformed business.">
      <p>We start with how your company runs today, then put AI where it makes the biggest difference.</p>
    </SectionHead>

    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="step step-feature">
        <div class="step-copy">
          <span class="step-num">Step 1</span>
          <h3>A comprehensive assessment of your operation</h3>
          <p>
            We map how work really gets done across leasing, maintenance, accounting, and compliance, and find where the
            hours go.
          </p>
          <p>Every step of every SOP lands in one of three buckets. Usually only a few need a person.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="buckets" aria-label="How each step of a process is classified">
          {categories.map((c) => (
            <li class={`bucket bucket-${c.tone}`}>
              <span class="bucket-name">{c.name}</span>
              <span class="bucket-note">{c.note}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li class="step">
        <span class="step-num">Step 2</span>
        <h3>A prioritized roadmap</h3>
        <p>Quick wins first, bigger bets next, each tied to hours saved or costs cut.</p>
      </li>

      <li class="step">
        <span class="step-num">Step 3</span>
        <h3>Real-world implementation</h3>
        <p>AI that fits the software you already use. No science projects.</p>
      </li>

      <li class="step">
        <span class="step-num">Step 4</span>
        <h3>A team that builds its own automations</h3>
        <p>We teach your people Claude Cowork, skills, and MCP connectors so they can build their own solutions.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .step {
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 30px 28px 32px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: #fff;
  }

  .step-num {
    color: var(--green-600);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .step h3 {
    font-size: 21px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .step p {
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .step-feature {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 0.9fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(28px, 5vw, 64px);
    padding: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
    border: 0;
    background: var(--green-900);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .step-copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .step-feature .step-num {
    color: var(--green-400);
  }

  .step-feature h3 {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 30px);
  }

  .step-feature p {
    color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.86);
    font-size: 16.5px;
  }

  .buckets {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .bucket {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px 16px;
    padding: 18px 22px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }

  .bucket-name {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .bucket-note {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .bucket-dark {
    background: var(--green-950);
    color: #fff;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(255 255 255 / 0.12);
  }

  .bucket-dark .bucket-note {
    color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.8);
  }

  .bucket-mid {
    background: var(--green-600);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .bucket-mid .bucket-note {
    color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.85);
  }

  .bucket-light {
    background: var(--green-400);
    color: var(--green-950);
  }

  .bucket-light .bucket-note {
    color: rgb(6 42 24 / 0.78);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .steps {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .step-feature {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
